  "description": "The Prime V3.2 is designed to pedal all day long and still feel comfortable taking on fast, challenging terrain. It is playfully composed, confidence inspiring and has a fun, balanced ride characteristic. Perfect for days exploring new trails, or blasting your locals.\nThe ability to confidently navigate through the roughest terrain is because of the progressive KS2 linkage. The optimized weight distribution enables a faster, more fluid ride. Experience true cornering performance with perfect balance and fistfulls of traction while reducing fatigue.\nThe Prime V3.2 is ready to take your riding experience further with the ability to fit a longer dropper, tweaks to geometry and refinements throughout. The Prime really is a true “all mountain” bike!",
